    "letter": "I write as the registered keeper of vehicle MT24KPL in respect of Parking Charge Notice OR410101. I dispute liability for this parking charge and require the operator to consider this appeal.\n\nThe Parking Charge Notice alleges: Overstayed paid time at Oakridge Retail Quarter.\n\nThe vehicle attended the location on more than one separate occasion. The first recorded entry and final recorded exit must not be treated as one continuous parking event without review of the complete sequence.\n\nThe operator should review the complete sequence of captures for the vehicle and date, including intermediate entry/exit records, rather than relying only on the two images reproduced on the PCN.\n\nFor the reasons set out above, the parking charge is disputed and the operator is requested to cancel the Parking Charge Notice.",
